{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":20981,\"title\":\"The Call of Cthulhu\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A dying professor leaves his great-nephew a collection of documents pertaining to the Cthulhu Cult. The nephew begins to learn why the study of the cult so fascinated his grandfather. Bit-by-bit he begins piecing together the dread implications of his grandfather's inquiries, and soon he takes on investigating the Cthulhu cult as a crusade of his own.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dCrOkzrWs8ux31oVCc1R8tt6zTC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bH0HBG088hmtPutVaUpjpOvZw8f.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"voteCount\":189,\"year\":2006,\"runtime\":47,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Fantasy\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":50000,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Andrew Leman\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":229182,\"name\":\"Andrew Leman\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":589130,\"name\":\"Matt Foyer\",\"character\":\"The Man\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u4NJwGmri7uw56Fv89RnSUt7YiV.jpg\"},{\"id\":589131,\"name\":\"John Bolen\",\"character\":\"The Listener\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":550448,\"name\":\"Ralph Lucas\",\"character\":\"Professor Angell\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tm91I4R0jkW6XoKmkmTYMyeUzb3.jpg\"},{\"id\":88340,\"name\":\"Chad Fifer\",\"character\":\"Henry Wilcox\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":589132,\"name\":\"Susan Zucker\",\"character\":\"Landlady\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":589133,\"name\":\"Kalafatic Poole\",\"character\":\"Bartender\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":125139,\"name\":\"John Klemantaski\",\"character\":\"Professor Bell\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5783993,\"name\":\"Jason Owens\",\"character\":\"Professor Quintana\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5783996,\"name\":\"D. Grigsby Poland\",\"character\":\"Professor Tutchton\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2678836,\"name\":\"David Mersault\",\"character\":\"Inspector Legrasse\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":196358,\"name\":\"Barry Lynch\",\"character\":\"Professor Webb\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n0y9euSOCwkSv99y7M4xv58Gifc.jpg\"},{\"id\":3137494,\"name\":\"Dan Novy\",\"character\":\"Esquimaux Shaman\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1166707,\"name\":\"Daryl Ball\",\"character\":\"Officer Cassidy\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5425066,\"name\":\"John Joly\",\"character\":\"Sergeant Bacon\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5784072,\"name\":\"Jason Peterson\",\"character\":\"Officer Stanton\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":10253,\"title\":\"Dragon Wars: D-War\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rEpvqWGu08coDLUpcpiz4sMoDYo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5WWqrUIGrCb1QvZtYVaSfZgUG8n.jpg\",\"rating\":4.6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ethan learns he carries the spirit of a warrior who battled dragons in 16th-century Korea -- and one day he'll find a tattooed girl carrying the spirit of that warrior's beloved. Years later, he meets Sarah and dragons soon descend on Los Angeles seeking out the two souls of the ancient lovers.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13025,\"title\":\"Diary of the Dead\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tGktSJW5dPf8QIjmcqum4KOEZPZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Gfk1gYXbEUKynbdTHza5DaPWS.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of young filmmakers encounter real zombies while filming a horror movie of their own.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":354251,\"title\":\"Southbound\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ehXtB1jlMx8FBlsX9JLhSQkvlZp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/31H6hObnaYoavamfzm2DWu7ofhc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On a desolate stretch of desert highway, weary travelers — two men on the run from their past, a band on their way to the next gig, a man struggling to get home, a brother in search of his long-lost sister and a family on vacation — are forced to confront their worst fears and darkest secrets in these interwoven tales of terror and remorse on the open road.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":296271,\"title\":\"The Devil Conspiracy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gZCWgbIq2IBDRMJmdx5NeYbbigL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sp7MPK2K60LLd7A6zjHKsfgjFil.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A powerful biotech company has breakthrough technology allowing them to clone history’s most influential people with just a few fragments of DNA. Behind this company is a cabal of Satanists that steals the shroud of Christ, putting them in possession of Jesus’ DNA. The clone will serve as the ultimate offering to the devil. The Archangel Michael comes to earth and will stop at nothing to end the devil’s conspiracy.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":43935,\"title\":\"Dylan Dog: Dead of Night\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nZdYn5IktnGVg7pRA2JHD1rdZDH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mbxu6J4qZ69JWNKITrHiR60IXx8.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Supernatural private eye, Dylan Dog, seeks out the monsters of the Louisiana bayou in his signature red shirt, black jacket and blue jeans.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13204,\"title\":\"Hellboy Animated: Blood and Iron\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/itj3KXrYL6iSa7eBDLYIVWZuZtW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iwAQV8m7jknUflreDmQpSdmmCmf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Hellboy, Liz Sherman, and Abe Sapien are assigned to investigate the ghost-infested mansion of a publicity-hound billionaire, they uncover a plot to resurrect a beautiful yet monstrous vampire from Professor Bruttenholm’s past. But before they can stop her bloodbath, Hellboy will have to battle harpies, hellhounds, a giant werewolf, and even the ferocious goddess Hecate herself.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16266,\"title\":\"2012 Doomsday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rNHdpeyBUki4n5tzEdEri5elJBq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Z5OHKXF0j06Wtm1dLSz7orY7jT.jpg\",\"rating\":3.2,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On December 21, 2012 four strangers on a journey of faith are drawn to an ancient temple in the heart of Mexico. For the Mayans it is the last recorded day. For NASA scientists it is a cataclysmic polar shift. For the rest of us, it is Doomsday.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":480210,\"title\":\"Truth or Dare\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l5Dyos3xViHP5ROuCi01P9Q6nZA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hnFln3IyJkw1J1j1EoyCuNUPTpq.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Eight college friends head to a \\\"Haunted Rental\\\" in a remote town for Halloween weekend. There, they play the game rumored to have caused the deaths of seven teenagers decades earlier, Truth or Dare. What starts out as vodka-fueled fun quickly turns serious when the dares become sickeningly dangerous and the truths threaten to tear the group apart. When players attempt to refuse the increasingly challenging tasks, they're met with deadly consequences, quickly discovering: you must do the dare, or the dare does you. As the death toll mounts, the remaining players must race against the clock to outrun, outsmart and outlast the simple game of Truth or Dare.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":158752,\"title\":\"Escape from Tomorrow\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g3qZofBWiLauJviv27f8zpEFbki.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AtUC9rFuBE43QQ0JyORuHw6fqEi.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a world of fake castles and anthropomorphic rodents, an epic battle begins when an unemployed father's sanity is challenged by a chance encounter with two underage girls on holiday.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":513857,\"title\":\"The Nanny\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h324sCgqkyQVre5a4uDfkXhm5c5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/grsp3vbmL41wKDRHQPvHxoXJpZW.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young Noa and Michael are put in the care of their new nanny, Leonor, who Noa suspects is a malicious supernatural being. Dismissed by those around her, Noa works to uncover Leonor's true identity, but soon finds herself with far more than she bargained for.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645753,\"title\":\"Blood Tulip\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d6kd64K86H9mQPoqHccLO4FGCv8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A woman travels to Holland in search of her missing sister who may have been forced into prostitution in the infamous Red Light District of Amsterdam. Ever wondered what would happen if John Waters went to the Netherlands to make a giallo? Wonder no more!\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"p6vTI7aDIHc\",\"name\":\"The Call Of Cthulhu 2005 Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}